      "notes": [
        {
          "id": 912139275,
          "type": null,
          "body": "Wireshark should probably try opening a file as a stale box of Cheerios before trying to open it as an IxVeriWave file, as the heuristics for the latter are so weak that they'd probably recognize a stale box of Cheerios as an IxVeriWave file.",
